{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "The Sphinx's Riddles",
  "description": "A riddle quiz decided by party vote. The Sphinx has 3 patience; every wrong answer or tie costs 1, claws the party and applies Addled, then she asks again. Solve all three for the Sphinx's Blessing (+60 shield for a flawless run). Run out of patience and she attacks: 8 rounds, and she yields at 30% HP. Next: blessed or yielded. Failure: lost the fight. Edit the riddles freely!",
  "entry": "sphinx_intro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sphinx_intro",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Sphinx of the Sealed Road",
      "text": "A lion the size of a house lies across the road, wings folded, a woman's face calm and ancient.\n\n\"Three riddles. Answer, and I will bless your road. Answer wrongly, and my **patience** thins. I have *three* patience. When it is gone... I dine.\"\n\n*Wrong answers and indecision both cost patience, and the Sphinx will simply ask again.*",
      "next": "riddle_1",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
      "id": "riddle_1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "title": "The First Riddle",
      "text": "\"The more of me you take, the more you leave behind. What am I?\"\n\nThe party must agree on one answer.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "footsteps",
          "label": "Footsteps",
          "next": "correct_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "memories",
          "label": "Memories",
          "next": "wrong_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "breaths",
          "label": "Breaths",
          "next": "wrong_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "coins",
          "label": "Coins",
          "next": "wrong_1"
        }
      ],
      "failure": "wrong_1",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
